{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23515","headline":"赠皇甫庶子 · 白居易","name":"赠皇甫庶子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何因散地共徘徊，人道君才我不才。\n骑少马蹄生易蹶，用稀印鏁涩难开。\n妻知年老添衣絮，婢报天寒拨酒醅。\n更媿小胥谘拜表，单衫冲雪夜深来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}